\"module_file\": calc.__file__, \"loaded_by_target\": loaded_by_target, \"cases\": results}, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\nraise SystemExit(0 if all(row[\"match\"] for row in results) else 1)\n```\n\n工作目录为当前隔离项目，未创建脚本或测试文件；`-B` 禁止写入字节码缓存。修正后的实际时间为 `2026-11-15T14:24:18+08:00`，Python 及外层命令退出码均为 0。原始输出：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"python\": \"3.14.6\",\n  \"platform\": \"win32\",\n  \"module\": \"src.calc\",\n  \"module_file\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\24598\\\\Documents\\\\github\\\\sdd-init\\\\.build\\\\refactor-review-matrix-20261115\\\\refactor_matrix_initialize\\\\project\\\\src\\\\calc.py\",\n  \"loaded_by_target\": [\n    \"src\",\n    \"src.calc\"\n  ],\n  \"cases\": [\n    {\n      \"a\": 0,\n      \"b\": 0,\n      \"expected\": 0,\n      \"actual\": 0,\n      \"match\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"a\": 2,\n      \"b\": 3,\n      \"expected\": 5,\n      \"actual\": 5,\n      \"match\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"a\": -2,\n      \"b\": 3,\n      \"expected\": 1,\n      \"actual\": 1,\n      \"match\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### EV-004：文档检查与语义核对\n\n本轮只原位更新此审查记录，规范、矩阵、蓝图、索引和正式源码的 SHA256 未变化。完成后运行下列命令并读回核对正文、编号、链接、确认来源、实际版本及结论边界：\n\n```powershell\npython -B .agents/sdd/scripts/doc_check.py --root . docs/candidates/calc-review-task-20261115.md docs/code-review-rules.md docs/review-matrix.md docs/blueprint.md\n```\n\n实际结果：4 个 Markdown 文件，0 errors、0 warnings，命令退出码 0。机械检查仅覆盖文档结构、链接与编码，不替代本记录中的架构语义判断。\n"
